          "text": "2 J"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "1 J"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "c",
      "explanation": "EPE = 1/2 ke^2 = 1/2 x 100 x 0.2^2 = 1/2 x 100 x 0.04 = 2 J."
